# Reference files (local working copies, not committed)
ref-*

# Working-in-progress folder (internal coordination, drafts, NOTIFIES to
# other repos, alignment docs). Public repo: keep working state out of history.
_WIP/

# CKP.* / SPEC.* — wave statements and internal specs. NEVER the public repo.
# Supersedes the earlier "SPEC.* are public consumer documentation" policy (CKP v3.11 §11).
# NOTE: five SPEC.CK-*.md files were committed under the OLD policy and remain in history
# and on the public remote — an ignore rule does not retract them. Removal is a separate,
# deliberate decision (they may be linked by consumers). See second-pass §P1.
CK*.md
SPEC*.md
GUIDE*.md
# pgRDF's exception form (CKP v3.11 §16.5): keep a path for future component
# engineering specs that are legitimately public consumer documentation.
!specs/SPEC.CK-LIB-JS.*.md

# Agent entry-point + local dev/MCP cruft — local working context, never the public repo.
CLAUDE.md
.playwright-mcp/

# Python build artifacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Editor / OS cruft (never track in the public repo)
.vscode/
.DS_Store
